        "difficulty": "Difficult",
        "introduction": "Use this guide to replace a worn out tire ring for the bobbin winder of a Brother CS-80 sewing machine.Over time and with constant usage, the bobbin winder tire ring in a Brother CS-80 sewing machine can wear out, break, or even disintegrate. You may need to replace your tire ring if your machine has issues with winding the bobbin correctly.",
